## Mapping decisions still open

- Whether `Person.emails` is designated professional-email-only or a dedicated work-email field is added.
- Whether `Person.phones` may store FullEnrich mobile/direct values or a dedicated mobile field is required.
- Incidental personal email should remain outside Twenty unless a separate protected review field is approved.
- Null Company A2 status must either be backfilled to `NOT_ENRICHED` or treated as eligible by the initial pull filter.
